 <h3><u>Ya imam e raza</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Ya imam e raza, ya imam e raza..(4)</p> 
  <p>Har nafas har ghadi, mere dil se yahi<br> aa rahi hai sadaa..<br> Ya imam e raza, ya imam e raza..(4)</p> 
  <p>1. Teri azmat pe bhala kyu na dalaalat banta<br> sher qaleen ka kis tarha na zinda hota<br> hai haqeeqat yahi, teri marzi me hi, hai khuda ki raza<br> Ya imam e raza, ya imam e raza..(4)</p> 
  <p>2. Ghair mumkin ko yu hote hue dekha mumkin<br> jaagti ankho se jannat me guzare kai din<br> usko kya ho yaqee, jisne dekha nahi, kabhi roza tera</p> 
  <p>3. Rabt kesa ye mere zehn me aaya hai abhi<br> jaise gehware ne fitrus ko shifa baati thi<br> wese hi rozo shab, baat ta hai shifa, tera sehne shifa<br> Ya imam e raza, ya imam e raza..(4)</p> 
  <p>4. Ab ke mash'had se jo palta hu to mere mohsin<br> saans lena mujhe acha nahi lagta lekin<br> fir bhi hai ye suku, mai kahi bhi rahu, dil wahi hai mera<br> Ya imam e raza, ya imam e raza..(4)</p> 
  <p>5. Kese samjhega zamana tere naukar ki hade<br> tere maroof ne bandhe hai samandar ki hade<br> badhte toofan ka, rukh badalta gaya, usne jab di sada<br> Ya imam e raza, ya imam e raza..(4)</p> 
  <p>6. Puchne haal nakeerain jab aae mera<br> maine dohraya jawaban jo qaseeda tera<br> wajd me aake fir, wo bhi kehne lage, mai bhi kehne laga<br> Ya saree ar-riza..(4)</p> 
  <p>7. Meri is waqt tere darr pe nazar hai maula<br> aur tujhe meri musibat ki khabar hai maula<br> dur uftaad kar, meri imdaad kar, tu hai mushkil kusha<br> Ya saree ar-riza..(4)</p> 
  <p>8. Ilteja aap se karta hu imam e hashtum<br> unke sadqe me jinhe kehte hai masuma e qum<br> jo pareshan hai, jald kardijiye, uski hajat rawa<br> Ya saree ar-riza..(4)</p> 
  <p>9. Jiteji jaan se apni mai guzar jaunga<br> jald mash'had na bulaoge to mar jaunga<br> ae imam e ghareeb, tum ho mere tabeeb, jald kar do dawa<br> Ya saree ar-riza..(4)</p> 
  <p>10. Apne is meer ko anmol banade maula<br> mujhko is daur ka behlol banade maula<br> mai azadar hu, nakhsh bardar hu, tere khuddam ka<br> Ya imam e raza, ya imam e raza..(4)</p> 
